{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udff0\u00a0<strong>A little fantasy of laughter and tears \u2014 a story for the grown-up heart.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An RPG on the brink of cancellation, riddled with bugs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the hero: hunt down the \u201cBug Mushi\u201d and collect the source of the corruption, the <strong>Bug Programs</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Bug Program you obtain becomes the key to opening new paths elsewhere!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No long battles or grinding\u2014enjoy a unique puzzle adventure and story that flow at a brisk, engaging pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect Bug Programs</strong> to unlock paths in this unique puzzle adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mature story where humor, nostalgia, and bittersweet emotions intersect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A complex world woven from meta-structures: virtual and real, past and present, failure and hope</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nostalgic yet fresh visuals: pixel art enhanced with post effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When this adventure to reclaim an irreplaceable dream comes to an end, you may find yourself wanting to <strong>retry</strong> your own dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcc5 <strong>Add it to your Wishlist!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Planned release: 2026</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We\u2019ll share development updates as we go!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa5 Streaming &amp; Let's Play Guidelines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>free to stream, create Let's Play videos, and share screenshots</strong> of &quot;RETRYS&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both commercial and non-commercial use are allowed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No need for credit or prior permission \u2014 but we\u2019d love to hear from you on X (@retrys_project)!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3830610?t=1758966807","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3830610?t=1758966807","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830610/84aac4912c43f9a6781c9047c7492e2223e2a087/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758966807","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830610/84aac4912c43f9a6781c9047c7492e2223e2a087/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758966807","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3892010,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>\ud83d\udce3Demo updated</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ve majorly updated the demo based on the feedback we received (latest update: Aug 29).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please give it a try \u2014 and leave us even a short review!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udff0\u00a0<strong>A little fantasy of laughter and tears \u2014 a story for the grown-up heart.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An RPG on the brink of cancellation, riddled with bugs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the hero: hunt down the \u201cBug Mushi\u201d and collect the source of the corruption, the <strong>Bug Programs</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Bug Program you obtain becomes the key to opening new paths elsewhere!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No long battles or grinding\u2014enjoy a unique puzzle adventure and story that flow at a brisk, engaging pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect Bug Programs</strong> to unlock paths in this unique puzzle adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mature story where humor, nostalgia, and bittersweet emotions intersect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A complex world woven from meta-structures: virtual and real, past and present, failure and hope</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nostalgic yet fresh visuals: pixel art enhanced with post effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When this adventure to reclaim an irreplaceable dream comes to an end, you may find yourself wanting to <strong>retry</strong> your own dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcc5 <strong>Add it to your Wishlist!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Planned release: 2026</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We\u2019ll share development updates as we go!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa5 Streaming &amp; Let's Play Guidelines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>free to stream, create Let's Play videos, and share screenshots</strong> of &quot;RETRYS&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both commercial and non-commercial use are allowed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No need for credit or prior permission \u2014 but we\u2019d love to hear from you on X (@retrys_project)!</p>","developers":["Studio Garage Inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830610/cd27289c475467a3ede5b83080e20e03276c1054/header.jpg?t=1758966807","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Studio Garage Inc.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<s